  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) Bareskrim division has formally designated former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and five other individuals as suspects in a high-profile treason (makar) investigation. According to police statements, the suspects allegedly engaged in conspiratorial planning prior to President Prabowo Subianto's inauguration. Official findings suggest the group aimed to weaken the current administration and maintain their institutional positions by monitoring and wiretapping influential figures. Authorities have examined at least 71 witnesses and secured various items of evidence to support the charges. While the investigation continues, officials noted that some suspects have denied the allegations. The severity of the charges, which carry potential capital punishment, has drawn significant public attention, leading to intense scrutiny regarding the legal proceedings and the motivations behind the alleged actions.",
